00:57:45.840 --> 00:57:59.420
<v Ira Glass>Thanks, as always, to our program's cofounder, Mr. Torey Malatia. You know, he told me the first time he went to a board meeting-- like, a real board meeting, at WBEZ-- he was totally disappointed. He thought there was going to be milk and cookies and all the candy you could eat.
<v Ira Glass>一如既往地感谢我们节目的联合创始人托里·马拉蒂亚先生。你知道，他告诉我他第一次去参加董事会会议的时候——比如，一个真正的董事会会议，在 WBEZ——他彻底失望了。他以为会有牛奶和饼干，还有所有你能吃的糖果。

00:57:59.420 --> 00:58:05.310
<v Joan Covici>It was very businesslike. It wasn't what they show in the movies at all.
<v Joan Covici>那非常公事公办。这根本不是电影里演的那样。

